	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d06r0101_swbell_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ベル『[Name:TrainerName ]　しってる？▼
ういている　いしは
おせば　うごくんだよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:47:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:44:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ベル『[Name:TrainerName ]　知ってる？▼
浮いている　石は
押せば　動くんだよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:47:39" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:44:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・続けてswbell_04
・0＝主人公名前</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T09:09:19" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:44:24" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:42:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d06r0101_swbell_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>それにしても　ここ　あいかわらず
ポケモンが　すきそうな　でんきを▽
たっぷり　おびているよねえ！▼
だから　でんきと　でんきが
はんぱつ　しあって▽
うかぶ　いしが　あるんだよお▼
もっとも　ぜんぶの　いしを
おせるわけじゃ　ないんだけどねえ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:44:28" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:44:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>それにしても　ここ　あいかわらず
ポケモンが　好きそうな　電気を▽
たっぷり　帯びているよねえ！▼
だから　電気と　電気が
反発しあって▽
浮かぶ　石が　あるんだよお▼
もっとも　全部の　石を
押せるわけじゃ　ないんだけどねえ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-23T09:09:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:44:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・周囲を見回してから
　メッセージ表示</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:48:06" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:44:24" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:42:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d06r0101_swbell_05"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうだった！
あたし　しらべることが　あるんだ▼
じゃあね　[Name:TrainerName ]！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-27T03:14:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:44:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そうだった！
あたし　調べることが　あるんだ▼
じゃあね　[Name:TrainerName ]！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-27T03:14:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:44:28" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・！マーク表示後にメッセージ表示
・表示後、d06r0201へ移動
　画面外に消えると主人公操作可能</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-27T03:13:30" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:44:24" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:42:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d06r0101_boss_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed mode="1" ]でんきいしの　ほらあな……
やはり　ここ　いいよね▼
でんきを　あらわすのは　すうしき
ポケモンとの　つながり▽
そして　ヒトと　ポケモン▼
ボクの　りそうの　ばしょ　だ[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed ]▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:43:27" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:41:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed mode="1" ]電気石の　洞穴……
やはり　ここ　いいよね▼
電気を　表すのは　数式
ポケモンとの　つながり▽
そして　ヒトと　ポケモン▼
ボクの　理想の　場所だ[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed ]▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:44:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:41:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・posで起動
・メッセージのみ表示
　動作モデルの配置としては画面外
・続けてboss_02</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:46:47" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>Ｎ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:44:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:42:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData />
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d06r0101_boss_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed mode="1" ]ボクは　いかねば　ならない
ポケモンたちを　すくうために▼
ボクは　とめねば　ならない
トモダチを　まもるために！[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed ]▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:44:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:41:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed mode="1" ]ボクは　行かねば　ならない
ポケモンたちを　救うために▼
ボクは　止めねば　ならない
トモダチを　守るために！[Ctrl2:CtrlSpeed ]▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:44:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:41:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・表示後、足音ＳＥ？
・遠ざかって行く演出</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:47:00" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>Ｎ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:44:18" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-05-22T05:42:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
